    "updated_at": "2022-11-24T15:49:14Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I think that's reasonable. https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#LegacyNoInterfaceObject seems to defer to https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#es-interfaces for requirements, but it's only really talking about implementation requirements and not recommendations for specification editors.\r\n\r\nPerhaps a warning similar to what we have for [LegacyNamespace] is appropriate.",
